# Goryo's Vengeance is an instant. Cast during Bot2's end step on turn 2 it returns Leovold, Emissary of Trest at once, but "the
# beginning of the next end step" (CR 603.7) is not that end step - it has already begun - so Leovold stays through turn 3's
# turn and is exiled only at the beginning of Bot1's own end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Entomb
Goryo's Vengeance
Island x3
Leovold, Emissary of Trest
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Search(Leovold, Emissary of Trest)
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Goryo's Vengeance.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Leovold, Emissary of Trest)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Leovold, Emissary of Trest.Power = 3
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Exile = Leovold, Emissary of Trest
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet
